    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description>Fundamental types for Arduino and native builds: Expected, Error/GenericError, ITimer/ArduinoTimer, ICloneable, and Arduino std utility traits.</description>
    <releaseNotes>1.1.2609: Error/GenericError, Unexpected/make_error, lib-utility.h (Arduino std::decay), const ITimer accessors. Removed errdef.h.</releaseNotes>
    <copyright>Copyright 2026 Roman Gorielov</copyright>
    <tags>native arduino atmelavr common system expected error timer</tags>
    <dependencies/>    
    <summary>For Arduino projects</summary>
    <packageTypes>
      <packageType name="Dependency" />
    </packageTypes>
  </metadata>
